    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Push.</strong> Once per turn, when you hit a creature with an attack that deals Bludgeoning damage, you can move it 5 feet to an unoccupied space if it is no more than one size larger than you.</p><p><strong>Enhanced Critical.</strong> When you score a Critical Hit that deals Bludgeoning damage to a creature, attack rolls against that creature have Advantage until the start of your next turn.</p>",
